notes.content:
I am excited to announce that the demo version of Fear The Timeloop has been updated to [b]1.3[/b]! Here are the changes and improvements made in this update:

[list]
[*] The sheriff's uniform has been replaced;
[*] The Italian translation has been slightly improved;
[*] Portuguese and Brazilian Portuguese languages have been added;
[*] Minor bugs with the save system and collision have been fixed.
[*] Sound effects for the enemy have been added.
[/list]

Thank you for your continued support and feedback! Enjoy the updated demo!
